      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: Each preset on my avatar requires 14 additional paramaters, 10 of which are floats. I cannot fit this on my synced parameter list as its already at 256/256. I'm using local parameters in the FX layer to store infomation, but they don't persist through reloading the avatar (changing worlds, changing avatars, or recallibrating). They all reset back to 0 as soon as I load into the avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
