      "value": "@{62633e380d4d1e528f91641e|full_name}: For what it's worth, I know it's a common term in the community to call parameters generated by a state behavior \"local parameters\" but it makes things very confusing when discussing them because we do have actual local parameters and they're not the same thing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
