  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-30T05:32:00.591Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In an attempt to create preset buttons for my new avatar, since it has a ton of customization and is out of memory, I used a copy parameter driver to copy the settings of my synced params to local ones and back again. It works, until you reload the avatar in any way. So, switching out and back in, loading into a world, or even recalibrating will wipe out the copied parameters and reset them to defaults. This defeats the entire purpose of my preset logic and is wholly disappointing.",
